This repository contains only packaging scripts (PKGBUILDs, installer and
update helpers). It contains no Tencent software and no vendor binaries —
those are downloaded from Tencent's CDN at build/install time.

WorkBuddy is closed-source Tencent software, subject to its own license
and terms. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported
by Tencent. Do not report packaging issues to Tencent support.
